{
    "title": "8 Pool Clash",
    "description": "8 Pool Clash is an online pool game for two. Do you want to compete with billiards players all over the world? We will match you with the right opponent. Download 8 Pool Clash and give it a try, you'll have more fun than ever.\r\n  \r\n  Players with good control can easily win at billiards. 8 Pool Clash simulates the real feeling of hitting a ball, allowing you to be there and enjoy the fun of billiards at home. As the number of battles increases, believe that your skills will continue to improve; you will meet stronger opponents and defeat them! Go to the next level and win more rewards.\r\n  \r\n  In each PvP game, both sides invest a certain amount of gold to win the game, and all the chips are yours! With the coins you win, you can buy items in the shop.\r\n  After completing a certain number of rounds, a treasure box will be presented, open the treasure box, and there will be a lot of prizes waiting for you!\r\n  \r\n  You can log in for free with your Facebook account to save your game data. You can also type and communicate during the game, taunt the opponent when he hits the ball, and don't let him hit the ball successfully!\r\n  The perfect ranking mechanism makes all players want to rush to higher rankings; we will wait and see who will become the champion!",
    "descriptionHTML": "8 Pool Clash is an online pool game for two. Do you want to compete with billiards players all over the world? We will match you with the right opponent. Download 8 Pool Clash and give it a try, you&#39;ll have more fun than ever.<br>  <br>  Players with good control can easily win at billiards. 8 Pool Clash simulates the real feeling of hitting a ball, allowing you to be there and enjoy the fun of billiards at home. As the number of battles increases, believe that your skills will continue to improve; you will meet stronger opponents and defeat them! Go to the next level and win more rewards.<br>  <br>  In each PvP game, both sides invest a certain amount of gold to win the game, and all the chips are yours! With the coins you win, you can buy items in the shop.<br>  After completing a certain number of rounds, a treasure box will be presented, open the treasure box, and there will be a lot of prizes waiting for you!<br>  <br>  You can log in for free with your Facebook account to save your game data. You can also type and communicate during the game, taunt the opponent when he hits the ball, and don&#39;t let him hit the ball successfully!<br>  The perfect ranking mechanism makes all players want to rush to higher rankings; we will wait and see who will become the champion!",
